# OSC 7501 (Program Status Protocol 0.4) inside ordinary output, as `cat` of a
# file would print it: the reports draw nothing and send no reply; only the
# `?` probe is answered. Whether a wait counts is the app's decision.
README\r\n
\e]7501;state=blocked:kind=permission:app=claude-code\aAllow?\r\n
\e]7501;state=clear\e\\done
